specs/user-journeys.md
specs/business-rules.md
specs/acceptance-criteria.md
specs/open-questions.md

Focus on what the application must do and why.

Do not decide technical implementation details during this phase unless necessary to describe an existing architectural constraint.

Each requirement must have a unique identifier.

Examples:

BR-PM-001
FR-PM-001
NFR-PM-001
RULE-PM-001
AC-PM-001

Every requirement must identify its source and evidence.

